{
  "lineCounts": {
    "Ladep": 28,
    "Paimon": 2,
    "Pharez": 22,
    "Player": 4,
    "Yasmin": 3
  },
  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "2303001",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Ladep",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "230300101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "230300101": {
            "id": "230300101",
            "speakerId": 12688,
            "speakerName": "Ladep",
            "text": "More data — that's what we need!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230300102"
            ]
          },
          "230300102": {
            "id": "230300102",
            "speakerId": 12688,
            "speakerName": "Ladep",
            "text": "How can your devices function without data to support them?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230300103"
            ]
          },
          "230300103": {
            "id": "230300103",
            "speakerId": 12689,
            "speakerName": "Pharez",
            "text": "So you suggest doing nothing till you get every single piece of data, huh?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230300104"
            ]
          },
          "230300104": {
            "id": "230300104",
            "speakerId": 12689,
            "speakerName": "Pharez",
            "text": "Will you analyze every incoming wave while trying to catch fish? No! You just need to focus on the one that comes with the fish!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230300105"
            ]
          },
          "230300105": {
            "id": "230300105",
            "speakerId": 12688,
            "speakerName": "Ladep",
            "text": "Now I see why you never actually catch any fish.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230300106"
            ]
          },
          "230300106": {
            "id": "230300106",
            "speakerId": 12689,
            "speakerName": "Pharez",
            "text": "Come on! You've never studied at Hara{RUBY#[S]Semiotics}vatat yourself! So just cut it with the wordplay, okay? We should really get to work.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230300107"
            ]
          },
          "230300107": {
            "id": "230300107",
            "speakerId": 12689,
            "speakerName": "Pharez",
            "text": "We can't afford more delays. Ours and Yasmin's theses might become obsolete if we take too long!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230300108"
            ]
          },
          "230300108": {
            "id": "230300108",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "What are you arguing about?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230300109"
            ]
          },
          "230300109": {
            "id": "230300109",
            "speakerId": 12688,
            "speakerName": "Ladep",
            "text": "You're...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230300110"
            ]
          },
          "230300110": {
            "id": "230300110",
            "speakerId": 12689,
            "speakerName": "Pharez",
            "text": "You must be the Traveler Yasmin mentioned. You've really helped us a lot.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230300111"
            ]
          },
          "230300111": {
            "id": "230300111",
            "speakerId": 12688,
            "speakerName": "Ladep",
            "text": "It's an honor to meet you, Traveler! An honor indeed!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230300112"
            ]
          },
          "230300112": {
            "id": "230300112",
            "speakerId": 12689,
            "speakerName": "Pharez",
            "text": "My name is Pharez, and I study at Kshahrewar.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230300113"
            ]
          },
          "230300113": {
            "id": "230300113",
            "speakerId": 12688,
            "speakerName": "Ladep",
            "text": "My name is Ladep, and I'm a student of Spantamad.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230300114"
            ]
          },
          "230300114": {
            "id": "230300114",
            "speakerId": 12689,
            "speakerName": "Pharez",
            "text": "Traveler, we could really use a favor from you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230300115"
            ]
          },
          "230300115": {
            "id": "230300115",
            "speakerId": 12689,
            "speakerName": "Pharez",
            "text": "You know that Yasmin has been sprinkling those potions around the Divine Tree's roots, right?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230300116"
            ]
          },
          "230300116": {
            "id": "230300116",
            "speakerId": 12689,
            "speakerName": "Pharez",
            "text": "Well... Um... The potions seem to have caused a little problem recently...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230300117"
            ]
          },
          "230300117": {
            "id": "230300117",
            "speakerId": 12689,
            "speakerName": "Pharez",
            "text": "Monsters of all kinds often appear at the potion-sprinkling sites.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230300118"
            ]
          },
          "230300118": {
            "id": "230300118",
            "speakerId": 12688,
            "speakerName": "Ladep",
            "text": "I never changed anything about the formula or its proportions, I swear. As such, this must have been due to... Um, some unforeseen circumstances.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230300119"
            ]
          },
          "230300119": {
            "id": "230300119",
            "speakerId": 12689,
            "speakerName": "Pharez",
            "text": "Whatever you say... Anyway, Traveler, please come with us to check the sites where Yasmin sprinkled the potions.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230300120"
            ]
          },
          "230300120": {
            "id": "230300120",
            "speakerId": 12689,
            "speakerName": "Pharez",
            "text": "There are probably lots of monsters, which precludes us from going there ourselves... We're going to need a companion with great martial prowess.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230300121"
            ]
          },
          "230300121": {
            "id": "230300121",
            "speakerId": 12688,
            "speakerName": "Ladep",
            "text": "More importantly, even if the Fungi are not that dangerous, if the problem created by our potions reaches our tutor's ears...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230300122"
            ]
          },
          "230300122": {
            "id": "230300122",
            "speakerId": 12689,
            "speakerName": "Pharez",
            "text": "Our thesis proposals will be doomed for sure...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230300123"
            ]
          },
          "230300123": {
            "id": "230300123",
            "speakerId": 12688,
            "speakerName": "Ladep",
            "text": "Especially here in Spantamad, where a single error in the submitted data will result in serious criticism...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230300126"
            ]
          },
          "230300126": {
            "id": "230300126",
            "speakerId": 12689,
            "speakerName": "Pharez",
            "text": "Well, hiring an adventurer is the usual solution. We've also turned to our tutor before, asking him to help find us some trustworthy Eremite members.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230300127"
            ]
          },
          "230300127": {
            "id": "230300127",
            "speakerId": 12689,
            "speakerName": "Pharez",
            "text": "But you know, a tutor's patience is not always infinite. Given the current circumstances, we're hesitant to trouble him again...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230300128"
            ]
          },
          "230300128": {
            "id": "230300128",
            "speakerId": 12688,
            "speakerName": "Ladep",
            "text": "So please, help us, Traveler! You're our only hope!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2303007",
      "subQuestName": "Go with Ladep",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
